  "observation": "A pinned floating application previously remained at (-360,30), below the real 400x200 output at (-400,-200). The owning changed-area placement now recovers it at (-360,-32) without unpinning or changing its size108x440/workspace2/draft. Real taskbar Minimize/Restore each submit once; actual client pointer press/release, physical keyboard editing and native painted pixels pass. The unchanged minimized-before-reconfigure and caption/MAX/snap/lifecycle regressions pass the exact tuple with normal cleanup. This advances UI-019 reachable application recovery; independent original acceptance and full release remain open.",
  "missingObservations": [
    "Independent original UI-019 acceptance and physical hotplug/AT/IME remain open.",
    "Pin/minimized recovery across actual output retirement, fullscreen/grouped/modal families and wider scale/rotation/multiple-output placement remain unqualified. Oversized windows retain their original size; the first up-to-32 logical pixels are recovered, not the entire client.",
    "Concurrent gestures/output changes, preview/capture/effect custody, protected input, Unknown and other asynchronous/native-host ordering or transport-failure schedules remain open.",
    "Full original hardware/resource/journey evidence, reproducible package and reversible deployment/rollback remain open."
  ],
  "modelScope": "Single compositor-thread same-monitor usable-area reconfigure with explicit translation/recovery/minimize/restore. Shared unchanged coordinate function; 10 named cases, retained pinned-exclusion counterexample and sampled safety/positive witnesses. No hotplug/transport/AT/liveness claim. An initial missing transitive test import failed and is retained; explicit import was corrected before production implementation.",
